WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,820
Everyone calm down first

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,460
The current disaster area is very large

3
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:05,260
The living supplies that can be allocated are limited

4
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:08,260
We can only prioritize ensuring that more residents can receive basic rations

5
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,260
We will continue to search for and transport supplies

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:17,760
Please overcome the difficulties for the time being

7
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,600
It’s getting more and more hopeless outside.

8
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,600
I have to hurry up and revitalize the small vegetable garden in my space.

9
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,600
Use these items to build a grape trellis

10
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:45,370
Last point

11
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:47,370
It should look good here in the future

12
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:50,650
Use your last bit of mental energy

13
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:52,150
Peeling seeds for the vegetable garden
